# Each component is its own git repository with its own history. The root
# repo tracks only the wiring between them: the agent identity, the
# opencode config, and the launchers. Vendoring them here would duplicate
# their histories and make every update a merge conflict.
ai-visualizer/
barehands/
backtalk/
fullstack-agent/
ai-memory-vault/

# Runtime output
*.log
supervisor.log
# Rotated logs are named supervisor.log.1, backtalk.log.2 and so on -- the
# supervisor caps the log and archives it, so these appear on their own and
# are not covered by the pattern above.
*.log.*

# Config backups
*.json.bak-*
*.json.*.bak